    glossary: [["Visitor record", "A document that can extend or change a visitor's stay conditions."], ["TRV", "Temporary resident visa used to seek entry to Canada."], ["Status", "The legal permission and conditions for remaining in Canada."], ["eTA", "An entry document for eligible visa-exempt travellers flying to Canada."]],
